Fix build against libtorrent-rasterbar 2.1 and GCC 16

Partial backport of upstream qBittorrent commit e154c1a811
("Support build against latest version of libtorrent"):
- lt::storage_params::mapped_files was replaced by renamed_files,
  and storage_params::path is now a string_view
- torrent_info::files() is immutable; renames live in
  torrent_status::renamed_files (use lt::filenames overlay)
- torrent_status::need_save_resume replaced by need_save_resume_data

Also add missing <cmath> include for std::ceil (GCC 16).

Only in b: build
